[38;2;124;124;124mYes! $\mathcal{E}(\mathbb{R}) = C^\infty(\mathbb{R})$ is a Montel space. This is[0m[38;2;124;124;124ma classical result. In a Montel space, every bounded closed set is compact. So [0m
